她发现这是个无可辩驳的事实。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/luyingdi_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"81":{"step":[[81,82,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["好吧……实际上，对于你的小说，我的确有一个出版方式上的新点子。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/luyingdi_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"82":{"step":[[82,83,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["说来听听！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/luyingdi_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"83":{"step":[[83,84,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["这件事情我已经足足想了好几周。你得先做好心理准备。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/luyingdi_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"84":{"step":[[84,85,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["如果我说——你的小说更适合作为三部曲来出版，而《隐喻神庙》将是它的上篇呢？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/luyingdi_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"85":{"step":[[85,86,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我不想说这是你需要修改结局的理由，但事实的确如此。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/luyingdi_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"86":{"step":[[86,87,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……三部曲？修改结局？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/luyingdi_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"87":{"step":[[87,88,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311401.png","audio":"612601635","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["天呐……我从来没考虑过这种问题！我的主人公还没试过跳