lse,"text":["亨廷为自己的猎刀擦上防锈油，转过头来还想说些什么——微弱的露营灯光下，睡袋里的虚构集呼吸均匀，双目紧阖。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/luyingdi_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"102":{"step":[[102,103,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["算了。年轻人的睡眠就像过冬的犰狳一样，真是让人羡慕。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/luyingdi_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"103":{"step":[[103,104,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["晚安，小天才。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/luyingdi_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"104":{"step":[[104,105,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["渐黑","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/luyingdi_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"105":{"step":[[105,106,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["长黑","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/heiping.jpg","choice":[]},"106":{"step":[[106,107,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["场景-办公室房间2","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"107":{"step":[[107,108,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["地标","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"108":{"step":[[108,109,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["嗯……果然还是三部曲的问题。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"109":{"step":[[109,110,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["如果三部曲是必须的话，我当然愿意再写两篇……但是，当我真的开始着手设计结构的时候，我才发现，这实在是困难重重！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"110":{"step":[[110,111,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["试试像《黄金三镖客》那样，分出明显的起承转合呢？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"111":{"step":[[111,112,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我明白你的意思，但是上个月你告诉我：“老人和牧童离去后，故事还不应该结束。”——那是什么意思？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"112":{"step":[[112,113,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["字面意思。你要让两名主人公主动地去结束这个故事，但又不完全结束。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"113":{"step":[[113,114,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["但是……我们已经取走了神庙的核心呀？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"114":{"step":[[114,115,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["当然，但你需要在这之后设置一个钩子——你要他们主观能动地踏入冒险。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"115":{"step":[[115,116,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["想象一下，他们拿着那块漂亮的小东西下来。然后，其中一人没来由地心生好奇——“嘿，我们为什么不去看看那背后是什么？”","","",